# WazHack/ZX — side-view player sprite, durable git-diffable source of truth.
# name: player   size: 16x24   (2 cells wide x 3 cells tall)
# legend: '#' = ink pixel (drawn, yellow), '.' = transparent (shows background)
# A side-on (profile) adventurer facing RIGHT: domed head, torso with a back
# pack hump, a sword held point-down in the forward (right) hand, and legs in a
# walking stride with boots. Proportions taken from the z-image-turbo concept
# (assets/gfx/player_concept_01.png); hand-tuned for legibility at 16x24 where
# diffusion output reduces to mush. Feeds gfx_convert --mode sprite (mask = ~ink).
#
